Supplemental notices for the classical WASM embedded in Scanic 1.7.1

Upstream package source commit:
https://github.com/marquaye/scanic/tree/dec0cd018899a7e1c5d8f4880223f0e54941f616

The upstream dev/Dockerfile specifies Rust 1.92. Its wasm_blur/Cargo.lock
specifies wasm-bindgen 0.2.100, cfg-if 1.0.1 and once_cell 1.21.3.
The adjacent files preserve the original upstream notices for these runtime
components, Rust and Rust's Unicode data. For components dual-licensed under
MIT OR Apache-2.0, the MIT option is used; Rust's Apache text is also retained.
Unicode data retains Unicode-3.0. Scanic's own MIT license is supplied separately.

This is a conservative source-based notice collection. It is not an attested
binary composition report from the upstream publisher. Build-only Rust macro
dependencies and unused Scanic ML/ONNX resources are not represented as shipped
runtime components.

